   "source": [
    "#To fill the null values of we need to take the help of either the mean or the median, so taking the mean or directly the median on the whole column is not correct, so we need to apply medain on the \"Category\" column, but not directly on whole column, we need to apply only to category wise , like for show,clothes,jwellery,etc."
   ]
